<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#compatibilityTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Identifies the governed concept, specification, platform, host, product version, protocol, plugin format, or operating environment evaluated by a compatibility statement."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#compatibilityTarget> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The target is an IRI. Profiles may require a SKOS concept for a closed classification or an identified resource for a version-specific environment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#compatibilityVersion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#compatibilityVersion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#compatibilityVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#CompatibilityStatement> .
