<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "developed by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/core#Agent> .
