<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a virtual-instrument product or version to an agent responsible for its development."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#developedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The subject is a product or version. A global domain is omitted because multiple domain axioms would infer that every subject is both classes."@en .
