<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasEvidenceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasEvidenceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a virtual-instrument source relation or compatibility statement to qualified source-fragment evidence evaluating it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasEvidenceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The subject must be the same resource named by modevidence:evaluates on each linked evidence relation. The exchange profile enforces that inverse consistency."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasPackage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasPackage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#VirtualInstrumentVersion> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasPackage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasPackage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has distribution package"@en .
