<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasSourceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#sourceRelationSubject> .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasSourceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasSourceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a virtual instrument, product, or version to a qualified relation describing its connection to a source musical instrument or state."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#hasSourceRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The exchange profile restricts the subject to a playable virtual instrument, stable product, or version. The qualified relation, not this discovery link alone, records source type, evidence, confidence, and source state."@en .
