<https://w3id.org/modavis/ontology/virtual-instrument#implementsInstrument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This is the version-level implementation claim. It neither identifies the stable product nor states which package bytes distribute that version."@en .
